  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Historical dataset of Building footprints in Evanston, Illinois as of 2025. There are approximately 27,000 different structures in the City of Evanston ranging from buildings to garages to decks & patios to swimming pools. This layer consists of the footprints of the different sections of these structures. Large buildings with multiple levels are broken down into sections by number of stories."
